{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0646A0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"法国第一次成功进行核试验，是1960年在阿尔及利亚的撒哈拉沙漠。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":88,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"当时也有很多法国科学家参加了曼哈顿计划。听说他们在二战期间被迫离开祖国，流亡到了美国。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"对。战后这些人回到法国，开始进行核开发。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"为了不必依赖美国的核保护伞，戴高乐总统对此非常积极。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"于是法国成了第四个拥有核武器的国家……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"……也有人说，核试验成功震慑了阿尔及利亚的叛乱势力。内战确实因此被遏止了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"但我从来不认为，只要有核武器就能换来和平。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""}]}